Content-addresses a delegation envelope (delegator, delegate, scope, integer-millisecond validity
window, prev_delegation_ref chain link) into a deterministic delegation_ref.
Built on the AlgoVoi substrate's RFC 8785 JCS + SHA-256
canonicalisation discipline (imported by hash, not modified), specified in
draft-hopley-x402-canonicalisation-jcs-v1
(https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/draft-hopley-x402-canonicalisation-jcs-v1/ -- IETF I-D,
sole AlgoVoi authorship). Conformance vectors:
https://github.com/chopmob-cloud/algovoi-jcs-conformance-vectors